{
  "version": 2,
  "note": "同一份评测集（29 条记忆 / 28 条查询）下的两组数字，按向量后端分别固化。baseline 把 subject_filter 换成恒等函数（等价于改造前的纯余弦排序）；hybrid 走当前 MemoryStore.search。--check 按当前 embedder 的 model 选择对应 runs 条目；改评测集或改检索策略都会让 --check 失败。",
  "dataset": "tests/data/memory_disambiguation.json",
  "measured_at": "2026-11-10",
  "runs": {
    "offline-char-bigram-1024": {
      "embedder": {
        "kind": "LocalHashEmbedder",
        "model": "offline-char-bigram-1024",
        "dim": 1024
      },
      "note": "确定性本地字符 n-gram 哈希向量（CJK 一元 0.3 / 二元 1.0 / ASCII 词 1.0），无网络、无 key，用于离线复现；不是 bge-m3。",
      "frozen": {
        "baseline": {
          "recall@3": 1.0,
          "recall@5": 1.0,
          "disambiguation": 0.851852
        },
        "hybrid": {
          "recall@3": 1.0,
          "recall@5": 1.0,
          "disambiguation": 0.962963
        }
      }
    },
    "BAAI/bge-m3": {
      "embedder": {
        "kind": "EmbeddingClient",
        "model": "BAAI/bge-m3",
        "base_url": "https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1",
        "dim": 1024
      },
      "note": "真实 SiliconFlow /embeddings 接口，key 仅经 SILICONFLOW_API_KEY 环境变量传入。两次干净复跑数字完全一致（run2 / run3）。首轮曾出现一次查询嵌入瞬时失败：q17 按降级设计返回空结果，baseline recall@3 / recall@5 记为 0.9643，其余字段不受影响；该次失败未捕获到具体错误类型，复跑无失败，故固化干净口径。",
      "measurements": {
        "requests": 29,
        "texts": 57,
        "entries": 29,
        "entries_batch_seconds": [0.713, 0.782, 0.618],
        "query_count": 28,
